### 9.7 Results and Discussion

In this section, the results of W single-spin asymmetry, \(A_{L}\) and W double-spin asymmetry, \(A_{LL}\) are presented along with a evaluation of full systematic uncertainties. The impact of prior STAR W \(A_{L}\) results and expectation from the new results on the helicity PDFs are discussed.

